    Keybox attestation service in system_server
    
    Move the keybox out of Settings.Secure, where every app could read the private
    key, into KeyboxAttestationService (keybox_attestation). The keystore hook only
    asks it to sign for the target apps. Add the TEESimulator switch
    (lenovo_tee_simulator), report the vbmeta digest of the boot as the boot hash
    of the attestation instead of a random one and keep the old developer-options
    keybox as a one-time migration source.
    
    Change-Id: I2aed1e7f8f395041199a85c48bbe72b2598df1e0

